OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal court judges overturn ban
OL,4,Aon Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal has overturned a
OL,7,Fban on Orangemen marching through a
OL,8,Flargely nationalist part of Northern
OL,9,FIreland on Sunday.
OL,11,FThe parade had been given permission to
OL,12,Fgo ahead along the contentious Garvaghy
OL,13,FRoad route in Portadown for the first
OL,14,Ftime in almost three decades, with
OL,15,Frestrictions in place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
