OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal court judges overturn ban
OL,4,Aon Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat decision was challenged in court
OL,7,Fon Saturday by a residents' group and a
OL,8,FHigh Court judge issued an injunction
OL,9,Fhalting the march ruling the
OL,10,F"long-running dispute" between
OL,11,Fresidents and local Orangemen had "the
OL,12,Fpotential to escalate" should it
OL,13,Fproceed.
OL,15,FDisputes over the Garvaghy Road route
OL,16,Fin the 1990s sparked some of the most
OL,17,Fserious public disorder in Northern
OL,18,FIreland's history.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
